WEBVTT

01:26.330 --> 01:29.780
[Glory]

01:30.520 --> 01:32.979
[Episode 15]

01:56.570 --> 01:57.700
What a pity.

02:38.520 --> 02:40.030
If only we could have died

02:41.240 --> 02:42.240
together.

02:59.960 --> 03:00.630
Miss Rong!

03:02.080 --> 03:02.680
Miss Rong!

03:06.760 --> 03:07.160
Hurry!

03:07.470 --> 03:08.330
Go check on him!

03:18.360 --> 03:18.910
My Lord.

03:19.240 --> 03:20.840
The suspect is already dead.

03:22.590 --> 03:24.190
Miss Rong, please forgive the fright.

03:24.190 --> 03:24.710
Guards!

03:25.079 --> 03:27.240
Take his body back
to the Government Office.

03:27.240 --> 03:27.710
Yes.

03:33.350 --> 03:34.250
Miss Rong, please forgive me

03:34.250 --> 03:35.510
for arriving too late.

03:35.870 --> 03:37.430
It's all because Jun Dai
is so inexperienced.

03:37.430 --> 03:39.230
He panicked like a headless fly.

03:39.240 --> 03:40.579
If I hadn't stopped him to ask questions,

03:40.579 --> 03:41.000
who knows

03:41.000 --> 03:42.860
where he would have gone for help.

03:47.750 --> 03:48.520
Mr. Lu.

03:49.520 --> 03:50.590
I know you pride yourself on being capable

03:50.590 --> 03:52.100
and making decisions on your own.

03:52.100 --> 03:54.230
But this matter is extremely serious.

03:54.470 --> 03:55.590
You knew He Xingming

03:55.590 --> 03:56.400
was suspected of murder.

03:56.400 --> 03:58.030
Why didn't you report it earlier?

03:58.030 --> 03:59.710
If Miss Rong had been harmed,

03:59.710 --> 04:00.980
could you have borne the responsibility?

04:00.980 --> 04:01.950
I'm fine.

04:03.150 --> 04:04.810
There's no need to make a fuss.

04:10.240 --> 04:11.640
Miss Rong, you look pale.

04:11.720 --> 04:13.250
We should call for a doctor.

04:13.840 --> 04:15.500
Then what are you waiting for?

04:21.390 --> 04:21.920
Okay.

04:26.310 --> 04:27.800
Mr. Lang, you've just arrived here

04:27.800 --> 04:29.730
yet you've already investigated

04:30.190 --> 04:31.920
the case in person and brought justice.

04:31.920 --> 04:33.390
Having a magistrate like you

04:33.390 --> 04:35.240
is a blessing to the people of Linji.

04:35.240 --> 04:36.210
You flatter me.

04:36.950 --> 04:39.010
Fortunately, Miss Rong was prepared

04:39.360 --> 04:40.830
and the assailant failed.

04:41.190 --> 04:43.120
Since the culprit has been caught,

04:43.190 --> 04:44.950
I'll need Miss Rong

04:44.950 --> 04:45.950
to testify later,

04:46.270 --> 04:47.630
so we can close the case.

04:48.000 --> 04:49.120
I have official matters to attend to,

04:49.120 --> 04:50.430
so I can't stay long today.

04:50.430 --> 04:51.630
I shall take my leave.

04:51.830 --> 04:52.630
Of course.

04:53.390 --> 04:55.000
After I've taken care of things at home,

04:55.000 --> 04:56.860
I'll come to the Government Office
to give my statement.

04:56.860 --> 04:59.130
Xiu Qiong, please see Mr. Lang out for me.

05:00.600 --> 05:02.060
Mr. Lang, this way please.

05:11.240 --> 05:12.900
Hua and Hesi have been in jail.

05:13.600 --> 05:15.460
How did you get their confession?

05:16.270 --> 05:16.870
Jun Dai.

05:17.830 --> 05:18.430
Miss Rong.

05:18.680 --> 05:19.800
The Government Office arrested the people

05:19.800 --> 05:20.890
from Xinfang Pavilion.

05:20.890 --> 05:22.270
I followed Mr. Lu's orders

05:22.270 --> 05:23.830
to paid 20 taels of silver as bail.

05:23.830 --> 05:25.630
Hua did the same, trying to escape,

05:25.630 --> 05:26.890
which led Hesi to kill.

05:27.390 --> 05:29.320
That's how the truth came to light.

05:29.680 --> 05:31.080
In my haste to gain merit,

05:31.270 --> 05:32.930
I put you in danger, Miss Rong.

05:33.190 --> 05:34.270
Please forgive me.

05:34.680 --> 05:35.940
This isn't your fault.

05:36.120 --> 05:37.050
You did well.

05:37.830 --> 05:39.159
Go collect your reward.

05:39.990 --> 05:41.750
Thank you, Miss Rong.

05:42.270 --> 05:42.830
Go.

05:51.570 --> 05:52.830
Is there really a secret passage

05:52.830 --> 05:53.680
in your room?

05:55.060 --> 05:57.360
Is there really treasure
in that secret chamber?

05:57.360 --> 05:59.090
And that mechanism just now...

06:00.430 --> 06:01.230
What's wrong?

06:01.830 --> 06:03.160
Quick, sit down.

06:07.320 --> 06:08.390
You look so pale.

06:10.800 --> 06:12.130
And your hands are cold.

06:13.120 --> 06:14.880
I'll get the doctor to check you.

06:14.880 --> 06:17.140
Why don't you think more about yourself?

06:17.380 --> 06:18.430
You've been constantly appearing

06:18.430 --> 06:19.890
in front of Lang Zhusheng.

06:19.960 --> 06:21.960
He may not be able to kill you openly,

06:21.990 --> 06:24.520
but behind the scenes,
he could strike again.

06:25.990 --> 06:27.270
Lu Jianglai, the Inspector General,

06:27.270 --> 06:28.400
died in a shipwreck.

06:28.700 --> 06:29.950
Everyone knows that.

06:31.190 --> 06:31.920
Now I'm

06:32.390 --> 06:33.920
neither an official nor do I have

06:33.920 --> 06:35.310
any attendants to bear witness.

06:35.310 --> 06:37.390
Impersonating an imperial envoy
is a capital crime.

06:37.390 --> 06:38.000
They're just waiting for

06:38.000 --> 06:39.460
me to walk into their trap.

06:40.480 --> 06:41.190
Right now,

06:42.659 --> 06:45.120
I'm counting entirely
on you to keep me safe.

06:50.330 --> 06:51.570
Inspector General?

06:55.880 --> 07:00.850
[Hualin Courtyard]

07:11.510 --> 07:12.310
Young Master.

07:15.390 --> 07:16.430
The doctor said

07:16.510 --> 07:18.020
Miss Rong's only been frightened

07:18.020 --> 07:19.120
and is fine.

07:19.390 --> 07:21.120
Why are you still lingering here?

07:21.120 --> 07:22.560
If you're so worried,

07:22.560 --> 07:23.470
just take your bedding

07:23.470 --> 07:24.530
and sleep in there.

07:25.480 --> 07:26.560
Spare me, Young Master.

07:26.560 --> 07:28.560
I won't dare speak out of turn again.

07:29.430 --> 07:30.720
Before dying,

07:31.000 --> 07:33.060
He Xingming said something strange.

07:33.560 --> 07:35.360
He said that before the killing,

07:35.480 --> 07:37.409
Yang Dingchen had a sudden attack,

07:37.600 --> 07:39.190
and was on the verge of death.

07:39.190 --> 07:40.360
He is full of tricks.

07:40.480 --> 07:42.240
It must be his excuse
to escape punishment.

07:42.240 --> 07:43.170
I don't think so.

07:44.200 --> 07:45.909
Young Master, do you mean that

07:46.950 --> 07:47.920
it was Miss Rong?

07:51.390 --> 07:53.120
One must think things through.

07:53.180 --> 07:54.450
If Miss Rong intended to kill,

07:54.450 --> 07:56.070
why would she let him die in Qilan Garden?

07:56.070 --> 07:56.600
Then,

07:58.180 --> 08:00.710
I'll go and see

08:00.990 --> 08:03.390
whether Mr. Yang has any chronic ailments.

08:12.830 --> 08:14.830
It seems something has been missed.

08:15.840 --> 08:17.100
But what exactly is it?

08:32.309 --> 08:33.000
Fusheng.

08:35.000 --> 08:36.000
Yunwan

08:37.200 --> 08:38.200
was killed.

08:43.630 --> 08:44.200
Jun Dai!

08:45.150 --> 08:45.630
Jun Dai!

08:47.220 --> 08:48.020
Young Master.

08:48.200 --> 08:48.790
What's wrong?

08:48.790 --> 08:49.270
Jun Dai.

08:50.270 --> 08:51.360
Has Lady Yunwan's funeral

08:51.360 --> 08:52.000
been handled entirely

08:52.000 --> 08:53.200
by Miss Rong herself?

08:53.600 --> 08:54.330
Yes, indeed.

08:54.480 --> 08:56.360
Miss Rong loved Lady Yunwan the most.

08:56.360 --> 08:58.000
She personally took care
of all the funeral matters

08:58.000 --> 08:59.840
and wouldn't let anyone else handle it.

08:59.840 --> 09:00.550
She also said the Rong family

09:00.550 --> 09:01.790
had no place for Lady Yunwan,

09:01.790 --> 09:03.270
so she would bury her in person
on Tea Mountain.

09:03.270 --> 09:03.790
Right?

09:04.550 --> 09:05.350
What's wrong?

09:10.600 --> 09:12.150
Where are you going, Young Master?

09:12.150 --> 09:12.740
Young Master!

09:12.740 --> 09:15.070
Young Master, where are you going so late?

09:16.920 --> 09:17.720
Young Master!

09:28.330 --> 09:30.260
[Tomb of Rong Yunwan. Unmarried.]

09:35.480 --> 09:36.080
Come here.

09:41.120 --> 09:41.920
Young Master.

09:42.060 --> 09:44.120
This... this is Lady Yunwan's grave.

09:44.610 --> 09:45.870
If Miss Rong finds out,

09:45.960 --> 09:46.720
I'm afraid I'll be

09:46.720 --> 09:47.750
skinned alive.

09:48.360 --> 09:49.090
I don't dare.

09:49.430 --> 09:50.560
I really don't dare!

10:06.720 --> 10:07.520
Young Master.

10:12.870 --> 10:14.120
I'm sticking with you

10:14.270 --> 10:15.510
and won't change my mind.

10:15.510 --> 10:16.830
If Miss Rong holds us to account,

10:16.830 --> 10:18.690
I'm counting on you to protect me.

10:22.510 --> 10:23.040
Let's go.

11:07.270 --> 11:08.730
Every time I close my eyes,

11:09.480 --> 11:10.740
I see you smiling at me.

11:12.390 --> 11:14.480
I reach out, wanting to pinch your cheek,

11:14.480 --> 11:15.680
but then you're gone.

11:16.270 --> 11:17.360
I thought

11:18.840 --> 11:20.320
you must be afraid

11:21.360 --> 11:22.720
here alone,

11:24.120 --> 11:25.390
wanting to talk to me.

11:26.840 --> 11:28.370
So I came through the night.

11:29.840 --> 11:31.640
I buried you behind Tea Mountain

11:32.480 --> 11:33.320
only because this is where

11:33.320 --> 11:34.320
I often come to.

11:35.330 --> 11:36.020
From now on,

11:37.460 --> 11:39.660
I'll come to keep you company every day.

11:40.320 --> 11:42.180
Then you won't be afraid anymore.

12:14.670 --> 12:15.240
Wait.

12:17.550 --> 12:18.350
Young Master.

12:19.030 --> 12:19.670
Didn't you say

12:19.670 --> 12:21.120
Lady Yunwan's death was suspicious

12:21.120 --> 12:22.850
and you wanted to investigate?

12:26.600 --> 12:27.260
Never mind.

12:28.390 --> 12:29.990
Perhaps I was overthinking.

12:31.960 --> 12:32.630
Let's go.

12:34.240 --> 12:35.700
Young Master, wait for me.

12:57.630 --> 12:59.790
Mr. Bai, I'm sorry for your trouble.

13:53.670 --> 13:55.130
You must be tired, Mr. Bai.

13:55.320 --> 13:56.520
Please have some tea.

14:05.700 --> 14:07.360
Lady Yunshu, you set this trap

14:08.000 --> 14:09.730
without giving me any warning.

14:10.190 --> 14:11.920
I don't mind being imprisoned.

14:12.950 --> 14:14.030
But my heart

14:15.340 --> 14:16.260
feels so cold.

14:24.270 --> 14:24.840
I...

14:27.430 --> 14:28.040
Cold?

14:28.730 --> 14:29.540
Where?

14:29.940 --> 14:31.140
Let me warm it for you.

14:40.450 --> 14:41.940
Don't be angry, Mr. Bai.

14:42.470 --> 14:44.960
If you get sick from anger,
no one can take your place.

14:44.960 --> 14:46.220
Where else could I find

14:46.240 --> 14:47.320
someone who cares for me

14:47.320 --> 14:48.250
as much as you do?

14:50.190 --> 14:51.430
You... tell me first.

14:52.600 --> 14:55.260
When did you discover
He Xingming's treachery?

14:58.240 --> 14:59.440
It wasn't difficult.

14:59.980 --> 15:00.670
Although I've always

15:00.670 --> 15:02.360
tried to please Yunxi,

15:02.790 --> 15:04.590
I was born to a servant after all.

15:04.870 --> 15:06.620
I've never earned Grandmother's favor.

15:06.620 --> 15:08.500
Even my maid Daisy

15:08.520 --> 15:10.380
often faces cold stares outside.

15:10.550 --> 15:11.320
That day she was

15:11.320 --> 15:12.590
deliberately led to the back door.

15:12.590 --> 15:14.440
Several maids from
the second branch were there,

15:14.440 --> 15:15.670
chatting and teasing her,

15:15.670 --> 15:17.200
even snatching her hairpin.

15:17.200 --> 15:18.920
That's when I grew suspicious.

15:18.920 --> 15:20.450
Daisy is naturally clumsy.

15:20.550 --> 15:21.600
The letter I sent you

15:21.600 --> 15:22.390
was switched by someone

15:22.390 --> 15:23.920
and she didn't even notice.

15:24.510 --> 15:26.630
So I hurried to Tea Mountain

15:27.070 --> 15:29.580
and intercepted Shanbao's carriage
on the way.

15:29.580 --> 15:30.250
Shanbao.

15:30.510 --> 15:32.510
I have something urgent to tell you.

15:33.320 --> 15:34.440
Get in.

15:35.530 --> 15:37.390
Shanbao only said she understood

15:37.510 --> 15:39.430
and told me to go back,
pretending not to notice.

15:39.430 --> 15:41.510
She'll handle the rest.

15:42.670 --> 15:44.360
After thinking it through,

15:45.120 --> 15:46.200
I realized

15:46.200 --> 15:47.800
you'd have to suffer a little

15:51.220 --> 15:53.000
to make this scene convincing.

16:03.080 --> 16:05.080
You suffered for three days

16:05.450 --> 16:07.180
but offered a favor to Shanbao.

16:08.430 --> 16:10.220
Shanbao never accepts favors.

16:10.660 --> 16:11.540
I suspect

16:12.000 --> 16:13.800
the recommendation letter for
your appointment to the capital

16:13.800 --> 16:15.590
is already on your desk.

16:16.080 --> 16:17.810
Once you take it to the capital,

16:17.900 --> 16:18.960
your career

16:19.060 --> 16:20.320
will be much smoother.

16:23.360 --> 16:24.720
The one who pledged loyalty

16:24.720 --> 16:25.850
to Miss Rong was you.

16:28.070 --> 16:29.400
But this can't be right.

16:29.620 --> 16:31.240
Miss Rong is so perceptive,

16:31.720 --> 16:32.720
how could she simply

16:32.720 --> 16:34.320
let her own sister be harmed?

16:38.720 --> 16:39.840
I'm not greedy.

16:40.720 --> 16:42.780
Whatever Shanbao doesn't want me to know,

16:42.780 --> 16:43.910
I simply won't know.

16:57.670 --> 16:59.330
Why are you pinching me again?

17:00.350 --> 17:02.150
See if you dare do that next time.

17:06.349 --> 17:07.000
I dare.

17:39.220 --> 17:39.880
Godmother.

17:47.180 --> 17:48.140
Shanbao!

18:09.310 --> 18:10.570
Miss Rong, what you did

18:10.630 --> 18:11.740
was too risky.

18:12.270 --> 18:14.200
If anything had happened to Lady Yunwan,

18:14.200 --> 18:16.000
I could never have atoned for it.

18:16.200 --> 18:17.270
Don't worry, Ms. Liang.

18:17.270 --> 18:17.830
I've been swimming

18:17.830 --> 18:19.200
in the river since I was four.

18:19.200 --> 18:19.790
A simple water jar

18:19.790 --> 18:21.390
couldn't possibly drown me.

18:21.750 --> 18:23.280
Everyone says I'm foolish,

18:23.350 --> 18:24.680
but he's the real idiot.

18:26.230 --> 18:27.070
But he is

18:27.070 --> 18:28.880
a vicious madman.

18:28.930 --> 18:30.610
What if he draws his knife?

18:31.000 --> 18:32.380
Don't worry about it, Madam.

18:32.380 --> 18:33.210
We had already positioned our men

18:33.210 --> 18:34.750
inside and outside the East Corner Gate.

18:34.750 --> 18:36.810
Lady Yunwan wouldn't have been hurt.

18:36.960 --> 18:38.420
No matter how many guards,

18:38.440 --> 18:40.240
we can't prevent all accidents.

18:40.440 --> 18:41.830
However, you and Wanwan

18:42.160 --> 18:44.220
can no longer stay in the Rong family.

18:44.640 --> 18:45.720
Since He Xingming

18:46.030 --> 18:47.710
conspired with Rong Yunxi,

18:48.530 --> 18:49.770
I went along

18:49.800 --> 18:50.890
and used a ruse

18:51.540 --> 18:52.190
to keep you

18:52.210 --> 18:53.670
away from the Rong family.

19:29.200 --> 19:29.730
Let's go.

19:42.300 --> 19:43.660
With Ms. Liang and Shanbao,

19:43.660 --> 19:44.750
I'm the happiest

19:44.750 --> 19:45.880
person in the world.

19:46.480 --> 19:48.740
I don't care about the Rong family at all.

19:49.080 --> 19:51.680
Of course it's better
to leave the Rong family.

19:51.680 --> 19:52.790
But I'm afraid that

19:54.550 --> 19:57.360
the Yang family won't give up.

19:59.090 --> 20:00.820
They've already taken action.

20:03.340 --> 20:05.230
[Rong Mansion]

20:11.270 --> 20:12.000
This is?

20:14.310 --> 20:15.200
Lady Rong.

20:15.840 --> 20:17.510
Thanks to Shanbao's kindness

20:17.770 --> 20:19.880
in agreeing to our families'
marriage alliance.

20:19.880 --> 20:21.880
They were said to be a perfect match.

20:22.590 --> 20:25.750
Yet my nephew was unfortunate.

20:26.640 --> 20:28.530
The match has suddenly come to nothing,

20:28.530 --> 20:30.420
leaving endless regrets.

20:30.920 --> 20:33.640
Our Yang family has been
in business for generations.

20:33.640 --> 20:35.790
Though we're not as prestigious
as official families,

20:35.790 --> 20:36.790
in Linji,

20:36.910 --> 20:38.200
we are also respectable

20:38.200 --> 20:39.730
and well-mannered people.

20:39.770 --> 20:40.400
We wouldn't dare

20:40.400 --> 20:42.880
disappoint your good intentions
for marriage.

20:42.880 --> 20:44.540
So we've prepared these gifts

20:44.720 --> 20:47.240
to honor the alliance
and uphold our promise.

20:47.240 --> 20:48.920
Honor the alliance?

20:51.750 --> 20:54.210
Yitang, come
pay your respects to Lady Rong.

21:19.310 --> 21:20.240
I'm Yang Yitang.

21:21.420 --> 21:22.860
Greetings, Lady Rong.

21:28.090 --> 21:29.420
Lady Rong, I've already

21:29.440 --> 21:30.990
informed you about Yitang.

21:31.590 --> 21:33.440
He surpasses his elder brother

21:33.720 --> 21:35.650
in both scholarship and business.

21:36.000 --> 21:37.720
But his pride has kept him

21:37.870 --> 21:39.530
from accepting the marriage.

21:39.850 --> 21:42.550
Today I've brought him
for your approval, Lady Rong.

21:42.550 --> 21:43.280
If you agree,

21:43.570 --> 21:45.230
he'll stand in for his brother

21:45.550 --> 21:46.920
and complete the union.

21:49.550 --> 21:51.270
It is admirable that the Yang family

21:51.270 --> 21:53.000
honors its word so faithfully,

21:53.810 --> 21:56.080
even willing to offer another son
for this marriage.

21:56.080 --> 21:57.550
But my eldest granddaughter

21:57.550 --> 21:58.960
has her own mind.

21:59.890 --> 22:01.890
I fear she may harbor reservations,

22:02.070 --> 22:03.600
so I can't agree at once.

22:04.590 --> 22:05.450
How about this?

22:05.880 --> 22:08.590
Let Yitang stay
at Xinfang Pavilion for now.

22:08.830 --> 22:10.350
Let the two meet first,

22:10.920 --> 22:13.050
then we'll see if they're compatible.

22:13.160 --> 22:14.720
It is only right that
a younger brother succeed his elder

22:14.720 --> 22:15.780
in family affairs,

22:16.310 --> 22:17.680
and just as fitting that he take his place

22:17.680 --> 22:18.640
in marriage.

22:19.030 --> 22:20.790
This was made possible
entirely by the your approval.

22:20.790 --> 22:22.440
Thanks for your great kindness,

22:22.440 --> 22:23.640
Lady Rong.

22:32.440 --> 22:33.030
Father.

22:33.510 --> 22:35.370
You know I'm unwilling to do this.

22:35.510 --> 22:37.350
No matter how beautiful Rong Shanbao is,

22:37.350 --> 22:38.720
or how rich the Rong family may be,

22:38.720 --> 22:40.640
I won't live under another's roof,

22:40.640 --> 22:42.640
spending my life at a woman's mercy.

22:42.680 --> 22:44.160
Not to mention that for this marriage,

22:44.160 --> 22:45.510
my skilled brother

22:45.510 --> 22:46.680
paid with his life.

22:46.920 --> 22:47.920
Can you really push me

22:47.920 --> 22:49.120
into the same misery?

22:49.680 --> 22:50.590
Sit down.

22:56.070 --> 22:57.110
Sit.

23:05.110 --> 23:06.000
Stay here.

23:13.240 --> 23:14.480
I know

23:14.660 --> 23:16.460
you appear gentle on the surface

23:16.680 --> 23:18.480
but are proud and aloof at heart.

23:18.750 --> 23:20.110
That's why I entrusted
this marriage matter

23:20.110 --> 23:21.440
to your second brother.

23:22.480 --> 23:25.590
Today has proven I was right.

23:26.390 --> 23:28.020
Who do you think you are,

23:28.110 --> 23:29.920
that you can treat the Rong family
however you like?

23:29.920 --> 23:32.250
If your elder brother had not
already been married,

23:32.250 --> 23:33.940
I would never have sent you.

23:35.350 --> 23:36.670
To be frank with you,

23:38.170 --> 23:40.710
the Rong ancestors were from
the Kingdom of Women.

23:40.710 --> 23:42.200
They later settled here,

23:42.480 --> 23:44.600
and married into prominent
local clans for generations,

23:44.600 --> 23:46.270
changing their ways over time.

23:46.270 --> 23:48.400
That's how the Rong family was formed.

23:50.700 --> 23:52.630
I've heard these women

23:52.650 --> 23:54.760
all possessed great treasures.

23:55.310 --> 23:56.840
Let alone sending just you,

23:57.110 --> 23:57.920
I would gladly

23:57.920 --> 23:59.790
send all your brothers to be chosen,

23:59.790 --> 24:01.750
if only they could all stay.

24:03.880 --> 24:04.790
Father, such words

24:04.790 --> 24:06.400
might fool others, but not me.

24:06.400 --> 24:07.400
The story is from

24:07.400 --> 24:09.110
hundreds of years ago.

24:09.350 --> 24:10.400
The Rong family probably

24:10.400 --> 24:12.110
just made it up to show off.

24:13.790 --> 24:15.110
Do you know that Dingchen

24:15.110 --> 24:17.200
once secretly sent a trusted aide
back to our Yang family

24:17.200 --> 24:18.550
to handle a matter?

24:19.480 --> 24:20.920
He had the aide find Madam Liu,

24:20.920 --> 24:22.550
who tends the rear garden,

24:23.160 --> 24:24.000
to identify a string

24:24.000 --> 24:25.440
of Bodhi prayer beads.

24:25.960 --> 24:27.350
Madam Liu's family

24:27.350 --> 24:28.510
originally served as attendants

24:28.510 --> 24:30.440
to your aunt when she married
into the Wei family.

24:30.440 --> 24:32.440
They returned to the Yang family
after the incident.

24:32.440 --> 24:34.370
As for this string of prayer beads,

24:34.440 --> 24:35.270
it was a keepsake

24:35.270 --> 24:37.530
your grandmother left for her daughter.

24:38.030 --> 24:39.750
Inscribed with sutras,

24:40.000 --> 24:41.040
one bead

24:41.070 --> 24:43.070
bears a tiny character 'Lan'.

24:44.270 --> 24:46.510
That was your aunt's given name.

24:46.830 --> 24:48.590
It's one of a kind.

24:50.400 --> 24:51.600
Father, is this true?

24:51.920 --> 24:52.980
Listen carefully.

24:54.550 --> 24:56.460
I asked you to stay at the Rong family

24:56.460 --> 24:58.460
not just for the marriage alliance.

24:58.790 --> 25:01.200
More importantly, you need to find

25:01.200 --> 25:03.960
the whereabouts of the owner
of this string of Bodhi beads.

25:03.960 --> 25:05.590
This concerns the very survival

25:05.590 --> 25:07.440
of our Yang family.

25:07.710 --> 25:09.790
It must not be taken lightly.

25:09.960 --> 25:12.520
You must be extremely cautious.

25:13.080 --> 25:13.830
Father.

25:14.900 --> 25:15.820
My aunt, she...

25:15.840 --> 25:16.680
Your aunt

25:16.710 --> 25:18.710
was murdered by Wei Kejian long ago.

25:19.540 --> 25:21.600
You must find that impostor quickly.

25:22.270 --> 25:23.110
She must not

25:23.110 --> 25:24.840
fall into anyone else's hands.

25:25.370 --> 25:26.680
If necessary...

25:32.730 --> 25:33.620
I understand.

25:38.350 --> 25:39.400
Send these tea leaves

25:39.400 --> 25:40.270
in my room.

25:40.640 --> 25:41.160
Yes.

25:42.550 --> 25:44.310
Tea appreciation is no simple matter.

25:44.310 --> 25:45.920
Outsiders have to examine leaves,

25:45.920 --> 25:46.920
color, and aroma.

25:47.030 --> 25:48.230
But Miss Rong can tell

25:48.440 --> 25:49.750
its origin in a glance.

25:49.880 --> 25:50.440
She can even describe

25:50.440 --> 25:51.550
the local climate

25:51.550 --> 25:52.350
and rainfall.

25:53.400 --> 25:54.550
Since Miss Rong is willing to teach you,

25:54.550 --> 25:55.240
Young Master,

25:55.240 --> 25:56.750
you should learn diligently.

25:56.750 --> 25:57.550
I know.

25:58.070 --> 25:59.470
I don't need your advice.

26:00.310 --> 26:01.640
You know it well enough.

26:01.640 --> 26:02.970
I've spoken out of turn.

26:04.220 --> 26:06.220
These are premium teas. Be careful.

26:06.300 --> 26:07.160
Put them there.

26:07.590 --> 26:08.070
Let me.

26:14.420 --> 26:15.860
I don't care about

26:16.740 --> 26:18.540
your past or where you came from.

26:20.160 --> 26:21.890
As long as you never deceive me,

26:22.110 --> 26:23.910
lie to me, or hide things from me,

26:25.110 --> 26:25.970
that's enough.

26:26.270 --> 26:27.640
Obviously, Miss Rong

26:28.030 --> 26:29.430
can't be easily tricked.

26:29.890 --> 26:32.150
Do you really want to try the impossible?

26:35.660 --> 26:36.260
Shanbao's

26:36.630 --> 26:38.960
tea appraisal skills
surpass even the masters.

26:38.960 --> 26:39.550
Even Old Madam Rong

26:39.550 --> 26:40.950
can't stop praising her.

26:41.110 --> 26:43.570
But this skill is never
taught to outsiders.

26:44.270 --> 26:46.400
I wonder what tricks he used

26:47.030 --> 26:49.440
that now she's willing to teach him.

26:49.750 --> 26:51.550
When you entered the household,

26:52.000 --> 26:53.200
Miss Rong treated you

26:53.480 --> 26:54.810
with special favor too.

26:56.050 --> 26:57.580
In this world, love and hate

26:57.590 --> 26:59.120
never come without reason.

26:59.760 --> 27:01.220
Mr. Lu must have his merits

27:01.560 --> 27:03.480
that made Miss Rong change her mind

27:03.480 --> 27:04.280
and her heart.

27:05.000 --> 27:06.400
Reflect on yourself rather than

27:06.400 --> 27:07.400
holding grudges.

27:08.010 --> 27:10.440
Try to see things
from others' perspective,

27:10.440 --> 27:12.440
and you'll have fewer restless nights

27:12.440 --> 27:13.900
torn by desire and longing.

27:13.900 --> 27:15.560
I'm not as magnanimous as you.

27:15.680 --> 27:17.110
He took away the one I love,

27:17.110 --> 27:19.570
and you want me
to admire and understand him?

27:20.100 --> 27:21.380
That's truly a dream.

27:25.590 --> 27:26.830
It's he who suffers from

27:26.830 --> 27:28.360
his own jealousy and greed.

27:28.510 --> 27:30.750
Why bother persuading him, Young Master?

27:30.750 --> 27:32.080
I'm not persuading him,

27:33.480 --> 27:34.810
I'm persuading myself.

27:36.550 --> 27:38.070
Be careful, slow down.

27:38.110 --> 27:39.040
Watch your step.

27:40.400 --> 27:41.600
Wipe this area clean.

27:50.590 --> 27:52.250
He reminds me of that dead man.

27:52.400 --> 27:53.530
If I look any longer,

27:53.720 --> 27:55.550
I'll have nightmares tonight.

27:57.160 --> 27:57.920
Take it slow.

28:05.390 --> 28:07.420
Mr. Wen, Mr. Yan.

28:07.880 --> 28:09.000
I've been so busy here

28:09.000 --> 28:10.550
that I haven't paid you a visit yet.

28:10.550 --> 28:12.070
Please forgive me.

28:12.950 --> 28:14.830
The old must leave for the new to come.

28:14.830 --> 28:17.070
As they say, money moves people's hearts.

28:17.070 --> 28:18.070
It is indeed true.

28:19.400 --> 28:20.030
Mr. Yan.

28:20.590 --> 28:21.880
I heard that Mr. Lu

28:21.960 --> 28:23.960
personally captured the murderer.

28:24.000 --> 28:24.750
Is that true?

28:25.070 --> 28:25.720
Yes.

28:26.400 --> 28:27.310
Mr. Lu obtained

28:27.310 --> 28:29.040
confessions from Hesi and Hua.

28:29.070 --> 28:31.110
He only made the arrest
after getting solid evidence.

28:31.110 --> 28:32.640
Luckily, he arrived in time

28:32.680 --> 28:34.480
and saved Miss Rong from danger.

28:36.070 --> 28:36.960
In that case,

28:37.480 --> 28:38.000
Mr. Lu

28:38.000 --> 28:39.510
not only saved Miss Rong,

28:39.910 --> 28:41.590
but also avenged my cousin.

28:41.880 --> 28:43.830
He is a great benefactor
to our Yang family.

28:43.830 --> 28:46.640
I must personally visit him
to express my gratitude.

28:46.640 --> 28:47.750
To be honest with you,

28:47.750 --> 28:49.000
I even went to the Government Office
three times

28:49.000 --> 28:50.160
and tried every means,

28:50.160 --> 28:52.010
but I couldn't dig up a single clue.

28:52.010 --> 28:53.830
Mr. Lu is indeed shrewd and capable,

28:53.830 --> 28:55.370
well-versed in all matters.

28:55.370 --> 28:57.630
No wonder he's gained Miss Rong's favor.

28:58.300 --> 28:58.870
Jie You.

28:59.480 --> 29:00.000
Go fetch my

29:00.000 --> 29:01.330
Fang Lanting inkstone.

29:01.400 --> 29:01.790
I'll need it shortly

29:01.790 --> 29:03.850
to pay my respects to our benefactor.

29:07.880 --> 29:09.740
Young Master, it's not in the box.

29:10.830 --> 29:12.030
Don't mess up the books.

29:12.030 --> 29:13.160
I'll find it myself.

29:15.030 --> 29:16.960
Excuse me.

29:17.800 --> 29:18.860
I'll take my leave.

29:18.920 --> 29:19.920
Please, go ahead.

29:26.640 --> 29:28.190
He just reminded me.

29:29.200 --> 29:30.930
Magistrate Lang made arrests,

29:31.720 --> 29:33.450
filling the place with people.

29:33.920 --> 29:35.520
How did he get the upper hand?

29:35.790 --> 29:37.250
Didn't I tell you earlier?

29:37.350 --> 29:38.960
The moment Lord Lang got the confession,

29:38.960 --> 29:39.680
he immediately sent someone

29:39.680 --> 29:41.160
to the Rong family with the news.

29:41.160 --> 29:42.000
He just

29:42.000 --> 29:43.310
ran into the messenger.

29:43.310 --> 29:44.310
It was just a coincidence.

29:44.310 --> 29:46.270
Neither you nor I happened
to be in the right place,

29:46.270 --> 29:47.600
yet he just happened to?

29:48.110 --> 29:49.680
Shanbao keeps defending him.

29:49.680 --> 29:51.810
Are you seriously buying his lies too?

29:52.070 --> 29:52.720
If he knew what was going on

29:52.720 --> 29:54.250
in the prison ahead of time,

29:54.330 --> 29:56.790
he must be colluding with someone
in the Government Office.

29:56.790 --> 29:57.480
Or worse,

29:58.640 --> 30:00.590
he could be a spy for the government.

30:00.590 --> 30:01.990
If he's a government spy,

30:02.720 --> 30:04.470
then why would he
infiltrate the Rong family?

30:04.470 --> 30:06.600
And why has he helped you so many times?

30:06.630 --> 30:08.070
After saving people multiple times,

30:08.070 --> 30:09.070
to be met with such suspicion,

30:09.070 --> 30:10.700
even I would feel disheartened.

30:10.700 --> 30:13.160
Mr. Wen, everyone feels jealous sometimes,

30:13.480 --> 30:15.550
but don't let it make you lose yourself.

30:15.550 --> 30:17.230
What you're saying is absurd.

30:17.510 --> 30:18.840
Don't mention it again.

30:22.310 --> 30:23.880
Mr. Yan is a good person,

30:24.340 --> 30:26.420
so he sees goodness in everyone.

30:27.350 --> 30:28.460
But little does he know

30:28.460 --> 30:31.720
that people in this household
hide their true intentions.

30:34.110 --> 30:35.790
Lu Fusheng is strange.

30:36.510 --> 30:38.200
If Shanbao won't investigate,

30:38.200 --> 30:40.260
I'll get to the bottom of this myself.

30:45.240 --> 30:46.790
Send a letter to Lord Lang.

30:50.030 --> 30:51.400
Immediately. Off you go.

30:51.400 --> 30:51.960
Yes.

31:05.550 --> 31:07.200
Quick! Have someone follow him.

31:07.200 --> 31:07.720
Yes.

31:17.000 --> 31:18.110
Please don't blame him, Young Master.

31:18.110 --> 31:18.790
Mr. Wen

31:18.790 --> 31:20.310
might be feeling a bit jealous,

31:20.310 --> 31:21.240
but he treats Miss Rong

31:21.240 --> 31:22.700
with complete sincerity.

31:23.190 --> 31:24.590
What he said makes sense.

31:24.770 --> 31:26.310
Ever since that Mr. Lu
came to the Rong family,

31:26.310 --> 31:28.170
there have been two murder cases.

31:28.270 --> 31:29.550
You mean no harm, Young Master,

31:29.550 --> 31:30.950
but you must be cautious.

31:31.000 --> 31:33.660
Try to find a chance
to talk to Miss Rong about it.

31:33.960 --> 31:34.590
Is that so?

31:34.680 --> 31:35.400
Indeed.

31:35.880 --> 31:36.790
You helped her complete

31:36.790 --> 31:38.160
the tea manual that had been
lost for a century.

31:38.160 --> 31:39.070
And you memorized

31:39.070 --> 31:39.720
all those tea-making recipes

31:39.720 --> 31:40.920
from Mount Mengding.

31:41.200 --> 31:43.350
Every time, you had
Miss Xiu Qiong deliver them.

31:43.350 --> 31:45.160
All the good deeds you do in secret

31:45.160 --> 31:46.940
end up letting others take the credit.

31:46.940 --> 31:48.670
Everyone thinks you're a fool.

31:48.920 --> 31:50.120
You make a good point.

31:50.960 --> 31:53.030
Some things I can let go if I don't know.

31:53.030 --> 31:53.960
But now that I do,

31:54.030 --> 31:55.960
how can I just stand by and do nothing?

31:55.960 --> 31:56.830
You're wise, Young Master.

31:56.830 --> 31:58.030
You should go to Miss Rong

31:58.030 --> 31:59.270
and report him thoroughly.

31:59.270 --> 32:00.680
I need to remind Mr. Lu.

32:00.910 --> 32:01.710
Young Master.

32:08.960 --> 32:09.510
Oh no.

32:10.680 --> 32:11.480
It's too late.

32:12.960 --> 32:15.260
This is tea made
by the mountain villagers.

32:15.260 --> 32:15.980
Take a look.

32:16.680 --> 32:19.210
How does it differ from
our tea plantation's?

32:26.590 --> 32:28.920
The mountain tea leaves
are somewhat scorched.

32:28.920 --> 32:30.650
And the aroma is also inferior.

32:31.030 --> 32:32.960
It's clearly the same tea variety.

32:33.070 --> 32:35.440
Normally, it's nourished
by the mountain dew,

32:35.440 --> 32:37.830
and the villagers have been
making tea for generations.

32:37.830 --> 32:39.000
But they often use iron woks

32:39.000 --> 32:40.400
and high heat to roast it,

32:40.440 --> 32:41.960
which makes it hard
to control the temperature.

32:41.960 --> 32:42.720
They also dump it into bamboo baskets

32:42.720 --> 32:44.000
while it's still hot.

32:45.030 --> 32:46.720
Even if the leaves are tender and fresh,

32:46.720 --> 32:49.250
they can't produce
the top grade tea this way.

32:51.830 --> 32:53.890
However, the villagers are carefree

32:54.070 --> 32:55.270
and disregard rules.

32:55.880 --> 32:57.010
Even a small mistake

32:57.270 --> 32:59.000
can ruin an entire batch of tea.

32:59.310 --> 33:02.200
This is also the difficulty
in starting a new tea plantation.

33:02.200 --> 33:04.160
These few batches are also from

33:04.240 --> 33:06.510
well-known tea plantations in Linji City.

33:06.510 --> 33:08.440
See if you can tell the difference.

33:19.480 --> 33:20.070
Go in.

33:23.240 --> 33:25.160
Shanbao, you have guided him carefully,

33:25.160 --> 33:27.640
but do you know
he has harbored ill intentions

33:27.640 --> 33:28.770
and had other plans?

33:30.590 --> 33:31.350
Mr. Wen,

33:31.720 --> 33:32.920
who's being scolded?

33:33.030 --> 33:34.110
You are.

33:34.590 --> 33:35.680
Thank you for

33:35.680 --> 33:37.030
all your help in the past.

33:37.030 --> 33:38.960
But for the sake of
Shanbao and the Rong family,

33:38.960 --> 33:40.440
there are things I must ask you,

33:40.440 --> 33:42.500
and I hope you'll answer truthfully.

33:42.880 --> 33:44.310
Today you ordered him

33:44.310 --> 33:45.550
to sneak out of the household,

33:45.550 --> 33:47.350
avoiding the patrols along the way.

33:47.350 --> 33:48.680
What were you planning?

33:48.720 --> 33:50.160
The Dragon Boat Festival is approaching.

33:50.160 --> 33:51.750
I sent him to deliver festival gifts

33:51.750 --> 33:52.640
to Mr. Xu, Mr. Liu

33:52.640 --> 33:53.880
and the others at the tea plantation.

33:53.880 --> 33:54.830
What's wrong with that?

33:54.830 --> 33:55.510
That's right.

33:55.510 --> 33:56.480
I came to deliver the festival gifts,

33:56.480 --> 33:57.610
along with a letter.

33:57.790 --> 33:58.720
It's right here.

34:02.270 --> 34:03.930
Miss Rong, please take a look.

34:05.120 --> 34:05.640
My Lady.

34:06.360 --> 34:07.550
It's just a few words

34:08.110 --> 34:09.440
expressing my greetings.

34:09.440 --> 34:10.670
You're here only for this?

34:10.670 --> 34:12.710
The Rong family has always
treated tea masters well.

34:12.710 --> 34:15.110
The festival gifts have already been sent.

34:15.550 --> 34:17.480
So why trouble yourself, Mr. Lu?

34:17.880 --> 34:19.440
Miss Rong respects talented people

34:19.440 --> 34:20.800
and pays close attention to detail.

34:20.800 --> 34:22.070
She often gives
the tea masters generous gifts

34:22.070 --> 34:23.280
like jewelry and fine clothes.

34:23.280 --> 34:25.110
Everyone in Linji knows about it.

34:25.110 --> 34:27.110
But the Rong family's generosity
to tea masters

34:27.110 --> 34:28.880
is simply a host
showing courtesy to guests.

34:28.880 --> 34:29.630
My festival gift, however,

34:29.630 --> 34:30.110
is meant to express

34:30.110 --> 34:31.440
my personal gratitude.

34:31.800 --> 34:33.280
During my previous visits
to the tea plantation,

34:33.280 --> 34:34.920
these masters shared all their knowledge

34:34.920 --> 34:36.030
without holding anything back.

34:36.030 --> 34:37.510
My gift is both a festival gift

34:37.510 --> 34:38.510
and a token of my gratitude.

34:38.510 --> 34:40.440
How could it be sent together
with the Rong family's?

34:40.440 --> 34:41.070
Is that so?

34:42.760 --> 34:43.400
Open it.

35:00.360 --> 35:02.190
Mr. Wen, I've answered

35:02.190 --> 35:03.320
all your questions honestly,

35:03.320 --> 35:04.650
without hiding a thing.

35:04.800 --> 35:06.030
This is the festival gift
I intend to give,

35:06.030 --> 35:07.070
how dare you ruin it like this?

35:07.070 --> 35:07.880
Why are you so anxious?

35:07.880 --> 35:08.920
It contains nothing but some cakes.

35:08.920 --> 35:10.680
I can simply compensate you if needed.

35:10.680 --> 35:12.550
I'm just worried

35:12.550 --> 35:13.920
there might be something inside

35:13.920 --> 35:14.480
that you

35:14.480 --> 35:16.150
wouldn't want anyone to see.

35:16.510 --> 35:17.650
Even a clay figure has its dignity.

35:17.650 --> 35:18.710
I've yielded again and again,

35:18.710 --> 35:20.030
yet you refuse to let it go.

35:20.030 --> 35:21.230
We are both guests at the Rong Mansion.

35:21.230 --> 35:22.910
How can you just search as you please?

35:22.910 --> 35:23.850
Ruining the festival gift
is a small matter,

35:23.850 --> 35:25.110
but damaging my reputation is serious.

35:25.110 --> 35:26.570
If this spreads tomorrow,

35:26.800 --> 35:27.630
will people gossip that you,

35:27.630 --> 35:29.110
Mr. Wen, repay kindness with betrayal,

35:29.110 --> 35:31.170
or will they suspect that I'm a thief?

35:31.190 --> 35:33.960
Mr. Wen, I suggest you reconsider.

35:33.980 --> 35:35.640
What if I insist on searching?

35:50.280 --> 35:51.480
Do you trust me or not?

35:52.710 --> 35:53.240
Shanbao.

35:53.550 --> 35:54.670
We've grown up together

35:54.670 --> 35:55.320
without any suspicion between us.

35:55.320 --> 35:56.180
He's an outsider

35:56.180 --> 35:57.670
with an unknown background.

35:57.670 --> 35:58.800
You should trust me.

36:05.880 --> 36:06.510
Wen.

36:07.720 --> 36:08.400
Stop it.

36:09.030 --> 36:10.640
You've been completely blinded by him.

36:10.640 --> 36:12.030
This is absolutely unacceptable!

36:12.030 --> 36:12.710
Wen.

36:28.950 --> 36:29.790
Give it to me!

36:29.810 --> 36:30.540
How dare you!

36:37.510 --> 36:38.190
My Lady.

36:42.360 --> 36:44.190
Is there anything else you want to say?

36:44.190 --> 36:44.960
Lu Fusheng.

36:45.510 --> 36:46.640
Who exactly are you?

36:47.110 --> 36:49.150
Why did you deliberately
get close to Shanbao?

36:49.150 --> 36:50.550
When did you bribe the servant?

36:50.550 --> 36:52.640
And where was that
wax-sealed letter headed?

36:52.640 --> 36:54.200
Shanbao kindly saved you,

36:54.440 --> 36:57.040
only to find you're a wolf
in sheep's clothing.

36:58.110 --> 36:59.570
You witnessed all of this.

37:00.180 --> 37:01.980
Shanbao, do you believe me now?

37:10.360 --> 37:11.280
I saw it.

37:12.840 --> 37:13.710
All of you, out.

37:52.070 --> 37:54.550
You should be more careful from now on.

38:02.280 --> 38:03.810
You're not questioning me?

38:04.030 --> 38:05.000
I want to know,

38:05.800 --> 38:07.530
but I'd rather hear it from you.

38:19.440 --> 38:20.510
I sent it to my mentor,

38:20.510 --> 38:22.110
Minister Xu, in the capital.

38:22.320 --> 38:24.280
The officials in Linji are all in cahoots,

38:24.280 --> 38:25.590
forming factions for personal gain.

38:25.590 --> 38:27.400
I can't tell who's friend or foe.

38:28.070 --> 38:29.530
So I can't show myself yet.

38:30.110 --> 38:31.280
I have to ask him

38:31.550 --> 38:32.760
to come to Linji personally,

38:32.760 --> 38:34.170
only then can he verify my identity

38:34.170 --> 38:35.300
and give me justice.

38:36.030 --> 38:36.800
But

38:38.000 --> 38:39.660
this matter is confidential.

38:39.710 --> 38:41.230
I'd rather let others misunderstand me

38:41.230 --> 38:42.510
than reveal the truth.

38:43.400 --> 38:45.550
Sorry for putting you
in a difficult position.

38:45.550 --> 38:46.230
Enough.

38:47.470 --> 38:48.600
I said I believe you,

38:49.550 --> 38:50.880
so I don't need to check.

38:56.500 --> 38:57.730
Now that the secret letter

38:57.730 --> 38:58.930
has been discovered,

38:58.990 --> 39:00.720
I fear I'm under surveillance.

39:01.590 --> 39:02.850
I'll need you, My Lady,

39:02.880 --> 39:04.280
to carry a message for me.

39:05.320 --> 39:06.120
I understand.

39:18.840 --> 39:20.710
You're staying at Xinfang Pavilion,

39:20.710 --> 39:23.190
and my frequent visits
have indeed drawn attention.

39:23.190 --> 39:23.760
You'd be better off moving

39:23.760 --> 39:25.220
to Hualin Courtyard soon.

39:39.510 --> 39:41.840
My Lady, are you really
not going to check?

39:42.150 --> 39:42.760
I won't.

39:51.110 --> 39:52.400
Even if I had ten lives,

39:52.840 --> 39:54.280
I'd still be scared to death today.

39:54.280 --> 39:55.400
Alright, alright.

39:55.710 --> 39:56.590
You're a grown man.

39:56.590 --> 39:58.030
Why are you crying like this?

39:58.030 --> 39:58.960
Wipe your tears.

40:14.360 --> 40:15.000
Mr. Yan.

40:17.220 --> 40:19.320
My place is a bit messy.
Excuse the appearance.

40:19.320 --> 40:21.070
Jun Dai, we have a guest here.

40:21.070 --> 40:22.400
Go prepare some tea now.

40:24.930 --> 40:26.110
Mr. Yan, please have a seat.

40:26.110 --> 40:27.040
I wouldn't dare.

40:27.550 --> 40:29.070
Mr. Wen has harbored resentment

40:29.070 --> 40:30.200
and caused trouble.

40:30.320 --> 40:32.050
I failed to stop him is my fault.

40:32.590 --> 40:34.030
If I had warned you in time,

40:34.030 --> 40:35.710
you could have avoided this trouble.

40:35.710 --> 40:36.880
I came too late,

40:36.950 --> 40:39.080
causing you to be wrongfully accused.

40:39.760 --> 40:40.490
These are...

40:41.480 --> 40:43.030
You've misunderstood, Mr. Yan.

40:43.030 --> 40:44.360
There were guests from the Yang family

40:44.360 --> 40:45.560
at Xinfang Pavilion.

40:45.720 --> 40:47.480
And moving ledgers
back and forth is inconvenient,

40:47.480 --> 40:50.940
so I'll temporarily stay in
the side room of Hualin Courtyard.

40:55.400 --> 40:56.110
Mr. Yan.

40:58.480 --> 41:00.230
Miss Rong trusts and values you

41:00.650 --> 41:02.110
far more than anyone else.

41:02.670 --> 41:03.920
How could a few words

41:03.920 --> 41:05.720
of provocation change her mind?

41:06.400 --> 41:07.660
I'm being meddlesome.

41:07.990 --> 41:08.550
No.

41:09.760 --> 41:11.460
Mr. Yan, you are honorable and upright.

41:11.460 --> 41:12.860
You are a true gentleman.

41:13.190 --> 41:14.470
With anyone else,

41:14.780 --> 41:16.760
it would've been lucky enough
not to be kicked while down.

41:16.760 --> 41:18.800
Everyone fears losing their own advantage.

41:18.800 --> 41:21.030
Who else would go
out of their way to help a rival?

41:21.030 --> 41:21.800
If there were more

41:21.800 --> 41:22.800
like you, Mr. Yan,

41:23.370 --> 41:25.570
the world would see far fewer disputes.

41:26.590 --> 41:28.190
Please don't mock me, Mr. Lu.

41:28.550 --> 41:31.210
I came to the Rong family
at my mother's request,

41:31.670 --> 41:34.070
originally hoping to forge a lasting union

41:34.320 --> 41:35.700
between our two families.

41:35.700 --> 41:37.150
Upon meeting Miss Rong,

41:38.070 --> 41:39.530
with her beauty and talent

41:39.670 --> 41:41.070
that shines so brightly,

41:41.150 --> 41:42.950
how could anyone not admire her?

41:43.550 --> 41:46.280
Unfortunately, her heart
belongs to you.

41:46.840 --> 41:47.840
I can't force her.

41:48.150 --> 41:50.210
I cannot force what isn't meant to be,

41:50.960 --> 41:52.890
so I'll let go of this infatuation.

41:54.590 --> 41:56.400
After Lady Rong's birthday,

41:57.000 --> 41:58.030
I'll be leaving.

41:59.230 --> 42:01.460
However, I have a few words for you.

42:02.480 --> 42:05.510
Being the Rong family's eldest
grandson-in-law isn't easy.

42:05.510 --> 42:07.230
If you wish to marry Miss Rong

42:07.670 --> 42:09.360
and be united like a pair of phoenixes,

42:09.360 --> 42:10.230
Mr. Wen's difficulties

42:10.230 --> 42:11.560
are just the beginning.

42:12.360 --> 42:14.660
There will be countless hardships ahead.

42:14.660 --> 42:17.050
Lady Rong's approval
will be even harder to obtain.

42:17.050 --> 42:18.450
You must be very careful.

42:19.190 --> 42:21.650
I appreciate your thoughtfulness, Mr. Yan.

42:23.760 --> 42:25.490
I will hold it close to my heart.

42:27.550 --> 42:29.410
[Hualin Courtyard]

42:35.760 --> 42:37.360
The wax-sealed letter
incident is over now.

42:37.360 --> 42:38.510
It's just a small matter.

42:38.510 --> 42:39.230
Miss Rong wouldn't

42:39.230 --> 42:40.480
kick you out for that, would she?

42:40.480 --> 42:41.680
Why are you so afraid?

42:41.720 --> 42:43.190
Young Master, you're being too bold.

42:43.190 --> 42:43.920
What if Miss Rong

42:43.920 --> 42:45.120
had believed Mr. Wen?

42:45.230 --> 42:47.290
Then all our efforts would be in vain.

42:55.470 --> 42:55.960
Move.

42:57.630 --> 42:58.090
What...

43:02.100 --> 43:03.160
What are you doing?

43:05.070 --> 43:06.360
We're moving these things
to Miss Rong's room.
